
  tray — a task tracker in two layers                     any key to go back
  
  Dump any task, or a half-thought, into the garage for the month you expect  
  to pick it up. Take it onto the tray when you are ready to work on it.      
  
  ╭─ garage ─────────────────────╮       ╭─ tray ───────────────────────╮
  │ anything, any month          │  ────▶│ what you do now              │
  │ no structure asked           │  ◀────│ priority, due, tags          │
  ╰──────────────────────────────╯       ╰──────────────────────────────╯
  
  (a)dd    a line to the layer you are on
  (t)ake   a garage line onto the tray, structured
  (d)      hand a tray task back to the garage
  (enter)  act on the selection; the menu lists the rest
  
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  
  keys                  acting                            
  ↑↓  j k move          a       add      d       hand back
  tab     switch layer  t       take     >       move to  
  space   select        r       rewrite  D       delete   
  /       filter        x       done     R       restore  
  v       show done                                       
